{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"马鞍面与鞍点：梯度为零不一定是极值点","goals":["通过偏导数计算验证马鞍面在原点的梯度为零","观察y=0与x=0两个截面切线，理解沿不同路径方向的升降差异","运用任意邻域内的函数值正负比较，严谨证明鞍点既非极大也非极小"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["双截面对比：借助y=0与x=0截面的对立走向建立直觉","路径参数化：将二维截面转化为一维路径t上的函数曲线进行对比","邻域反例法：利用极小邻域内必定存在正负值的定义否定极值"]},"reflections":[{"as":"section-04-reflection-01","prompt":"如果一个曲面在某点沿 x 轴和 y 轴两个方向都达到局部极小，能否断言该点就是局部极小值点？为什么？","answer":"不能。坐标轴只是两个特定方向：即使沿 x 轴和 y 轴函数值都增加，沿其他斜向路径仍可能减小。例如 f(x,y) = x² + y² − 3xy 在原点沿两条坐标轴都是 t² ≥ 0，沿 y = x 却是 −t² < 0。判断局部极小必须保证该点的整个邻域内都有 f(x,y) ≥ f(p₀)。","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-04-item-01","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-01","purpose":"计算马鞍面原点偏导数与梯度，引入双方向截面观察梯度为零时的矛盾现象","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"承接上一课，我们来看马鞍面函数 f(x,y) = x² - y²。首先求偏导数：f_x = 2x，f_y = -2y。在原点(0,0)处，两个偏导数都为0，因此原点梯度为零。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"f(x,y) = x^2 - y^2 \\implies f_x(0,0)=0, \\ f_y(0,0)=0 \\implies \\nabla f(0,0) = (0,0)"},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:1:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"强调原点偏导数计算结果与梯度为零"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"回想第一课的抛物面 x² + y²，它在原点同样梯度为零且是最低点。那么，梯度为零就一定是最低点吗？我们同时观察两幅马鞍面，两幅图的截面分别为 y=0 和 x=0。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:1:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","kind":"scene3d","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"截面 y=0","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 - y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 - y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 - y^2","x_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"y_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"samples":12}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:section","axis":"y","value":0,"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:1:2:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02","kind":"scene3d","role":"comparison_visual","content":{"title":"截面 x=0","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 - y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 - y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 - y^2","x_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"y_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"samples":12}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02:fragment:section","axis":"x","value":0,"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}]},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:1:2:3","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-02","purpose":"将截面降维为路径参数t的函数曲线，分析两个主方向上的极值差异","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"对于马鞍面，高度 z 等于 x 的平方减去 y 的平方。我们分别沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向取截面，观察截面上的一元函数。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"在 y 等于零的截面上，高度 z 等于 x 的平方。用路径参数 t 表示 x，高度就是 t 的平方。因此，在沿 x 轴的这条路径上，原点是最低点。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"y=0 \\implies z = x^2 \\implies z(t) = t^2 \\quad (t=x)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"观察沿x方向开口向上的抛物线截面"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"在 x 等于零的截面上，高度 z 等于负的 y 平方。用路径参数 t 表示 y，高度就是负的 t 平方。因此，在沿 y 轴的这条路径上，原点反而是最高点。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"x=0 \\implies z = -y^2 \\implies z(t) = -t^2 \\quad (t=y)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:3:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"现在把两条截面曲线放到同一坐标系中比较。横轴是路径参数 t，纵轴是高度 z。开口向上的抛物线，对应 x 等于 t、y 等于零的路径；开口向下的抛物线，对应 x 等于零、y 等于 t 的路径。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:4:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01","kind":"plot","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"截面路径参数曲线对照图","axes":{"x":{"min":-4,"max":4,"label":"t"},"y":{"min":-15,"max":15,"label":"z"}},"curves":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01:fragment:primary-curve","expression":"(x)^(2)","label":"(x,y)=(t,0)"},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01:fragment:curve-02","expression":"-((x)^(2))","label":"(x,y)=(0,t)"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-02"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:4:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z(t,0) = t^2 \\text{ (t=0处极小)}, \\quad z(0,t) = -t^2 \\text{ (t=0处极大)}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:2:4:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01"],"intent":"比较两条方向相反极值特性的路径曲线"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-03","purpose":"基于任意小邻域定义进行严格代数证明，说明鞍点非极值点的本质","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"我们来严格证明原点不是极值点。在原点任意小的邻域内，我们取两类特殊点：沿x轴的点(t,0)和沿y轴的点(0,t)，其中t不等于0。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:3:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01"],"intent":"引出邻域内两类特殊点的代数式"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"代入函数，f(t,0)等于t的平方，大于0；f(0,t)等于负t的平方，小于0；而原点函数值f(0,0)等于0。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:3:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"f(t,0)=t^2>0, \\quad f(0,t)=-t^2<0, \\quad f(0,0)=0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"因为这两类点可以任意靠近原点，所以在原点的任何邻域内，都同时存在比原点函数值更高和更低的点。这直接违背了局部极大值和局部极小值的定义。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:3:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-03-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"鞍点的代数本质","items":["任意邻域内同时存在 f(x,y) > f(0,0) 与 f(x,y) < f(0,0)","一升一降即可否定极值点","注意：仅两个方向上升尚不能证明局部极小"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"因此，即便梯度为零，原点也既不是局部极大点，也不是局部极小点，这就是鞍点的本质。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:3:4:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01"],"intent":"总结鞍点与梯度为零的关系"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-04","purpose":"总结多元函数极值判断的三课方法体系，并进行概念反思与自查","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"今天我们总结多元函数极值分析的三种核心视角。第一，固定输出看等高线；第二，固定输入看偏导数；第三，通过比较经过同一点的不同路径，来判断该点是否为极值点。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:4:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"多元函数极值分析方法体系","items":["固定输出：观察等高线形态与分布","固定输入：计算一阶偏导数与梯度","路径分析：比较过同一点的不同方向曲线"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-03-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:4:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"梳理多元函数极值分析的三大核心方法"}}]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-04:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"我们将旋转抛物面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方，与马鞍面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方在原点处进行对比。两者的梯度在原点均为零向量，但极值性质截然不同。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:4:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\nabla z(0,0) = (0, 0)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-04:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"对于旋转抛物面，除原点外，所有点的函数值 x²+y² 都严格大于零，因此原点是严格局部极小值点；而对于马鞍面，原点任意邻域内既存在正值也存在负值，因此原点不是极值点，而是鞍点。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:4:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-03-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\text{抛物面: } f(x,y) \\ge f(0,0) \\quad | \\quad \\text{马鞍面: } \\Delta f \\text{ 符号不固定}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:step:section-04:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"最后留下一个概念自查思考题：如果一个曲面在某点沿 x 轴和 y 轴两个方向都达到局部极小，我们能否断言该点就是多元函数的局部极小值点？为什么？","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:action:4:4:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-04-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"概念反思自查","items":["问题：沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向均上升，能否断言局部极小？","思考：坐标轴方向能否代表全方位邻域的变化？"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-03-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8","sequence":5,"result":{"summary":"本课通过分析马鞍面 z=x²-y²，证明了梯度为零仅是极值的必要条件而非充分条件。我们利用双方向截面和邻域定义揭示了鞍点的特性，并总结了结合等高线、偏导数与路径分析判断极值的完整方法。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-02","surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01"]}}
